10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] ## Problem Analysis
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] The Cover tool reported that it couldn't generate tests for the following methods because they create temporary files without cleaning them up:
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - `TAQWriter(File)`
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - `TAQWriter(File, TAQConfig)` 
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - And related getter methods
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] The specific issue was that files like `/tmp/test.txt` were being created during test generation but not deleted.
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] ## Solution Implemented
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.422 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] I enhanced the existing `TAQWriterFactory.java` test factory class by adding two new factory methods decorated with `@InterestingTestFactory`:
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 1. **`createTAQWriterWithFile()`** - Creates a `TAQWriter` using the `TAQWriter(File)` constructor with a properly managed temporary file
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 2. **`createTAQWriterWithFileAndConfig()`** - Creates a `TAQWriter` using the `TAQWriter(File, TAQConfig)` constructor with a properly managed temporary file
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] Both methods:
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - Use `Files.createTempFile()` to create temporary files with unique names
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - Call `tempFile.deleteOnExit()` to ensure automatic cleanup when the JVM exits
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - Are annotated with `@InterestingTestFactory` so Cover will use them for test generation
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:24:40.423 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] ## Changes Made
